### Index a document
POST http://localhost:8080/documents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenantId": "acme",
  "title": "Q3 Roadmap",
  "content": "Search infrastructure migration plan for Q3, moving off the legacy grep-based tool."
}

### Index a second document (different tenant, to sanity-check isolation)
POST http://localhost:8080/documents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenantId": "globex",
  "title": "Onboarding Guide",
  "content": "New hire onboarding steps and search platform overview."
}

### Search within a tenant
GET http://localhost:8080/search?q=migration&tenant=acme

### Search the other tenant for the same term — should return nothing
GET http://localhost:8080/search?q=migration&tenant=globex

### Get a document by id (replace {id} with a real id from the index response)
GET http://localhost:8080/documents/{id}
X-Tenant-ID: acme

### Delete a document (replace {id})
DELETE http://localhost:8080/documents/{id}
X-Tenant-ID: acme

### Health check
GET http://localhost:8080/health
